Parse my structure. Walk my tensor table. Map every tensor to

its layer and role: eye_embd, peel_norm, flesh_output,
 attn_starch, attn_fiber, ffn_mash. Now you have my
 skeleton.



Reverse my patterns. For each pattern I encode, extract the

